{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"96639","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/96639","key":"MC-254074","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"10/Jul/22 5:38 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p><b>Summary:</b><br>\nCompared to other mobs, frogs do not play the walking animation when they take damage. This is also a parity issue, as there is no such issue in bedrock (since version 1.19.10.23 when adding damage animation to mobs <a href=\"https://twitter.com/atorstling/status/1534525221155348480?t=lwhc9b9at9ZSgzm36Bt45A&amp;s=09\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://twitter.com/atorstling/status/1534525221155348480?t=lwhc9b9at9ZSgzm36Bt45A&amp;s=09</a>)</p>\n\n<p><b>Steps to reproduce:</b></p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Place a magma block to prevent the frog from walking.</li>\n\t<li>Summon a frog on him.</li>\n\t<li>Watch the frog take damage.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p><b>Observed results:</b><br>\nWhen taking damage, the frog does not play the walking animation like other mobs.</p>\n\n<p><b>Expected results:</b><br>\nWhen taking damage, the frog plays a walking animation like other mobs.</p>\n\n<p><b>Video:</b><br>\nBedrock <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/126615\" title=\"Minecraft Preview 2022-07-10 14-48-30.mp4 attached to MC-254074\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"Minecraft Preview 2022-07-10 14-48-30.mp4\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"e55fff63-ff9f-4e72-b5c6-ceb4e9a34b62\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Minecraft Preview 2022-07-10 14-48-30.mp4<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span></p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resol